    <!-- Mirrors the authored Warcraft 3.icp touchscreenGestures and
         wc3_profile_apply_gesture_mode(): the no-double-tap mode clears every
         double-tap package and maps the long press to the right button.  The
         second-finger tap/drag actions are empty; two-finger swipes remain
         bound to the Sd2 camera scroll keys. -->
    <string name="launch_gesture_hint_double">• Single tap — LMB (with delay)\n• Double tap — RMB\n• Long press — A + LMB\n• Single-finger drag — MMB\n• Long-press drag — LMB\n• Double-tap drag — LMB\n• Two-finger swipe up/down — camera tilt\n• Two-finger swipe left/right — camera rotation</string>
    <string name="launch_gesture_hint_single">• Single tap — LMB (immediately)\n• Long press — RMB\n• Single-finger drag — MMB\n• Long-press drag — LMB\n• Two-finger swipe up/down — camera tilt\n• Two-finger swipe left/right — camera rotation</string>
